ficielles ?\n- concerneAep: Cette restriction est-elle appliqu\u00e9e \u00e0 l'eau potable ?\n- description: Description de la restriction\n\nInformation suppl\u00e9mentaire\n\nLa pr\u00e9cision des coordonn\u00e9es est \u00e9gale \u00e0 5 d\u00e9cimales.", "extras": {"analysis:error": "File too large to download", "analysis:last-modified-at": "2024-06-27T09:36:34+00:00", "analysis:last-modified-detection": "last-modified-header", "check:available": true, "check:date": "2024-06-27T12:06:01.619317+00:00", "check:headers:content-length": 4458848786, "check:headers:content-type": "binary/octet-stream", "check:status": 200, "check:timeout": false}, "filesize": 4150000000, "filetype": "remote", "format": "zip", "harvest": null, "id": "46cc247a-5fab-40df-b7a0-dd9c719a5e7f", "internal": {"created_at_internal": "2024-06-27T09:30:34.065000+00:00", "last_modified_internal": "2024-06-27T12:05:58.492000+00:00"}, "last_modified": "2024-06-27T09:36:34+00:00", "latest": "https://www.data.gouv.fr/api/1/datasets/r/46cc247a-5fab-40df-b7a0-dd9c719a5e7f", "metrics": {"views": 456}, "mime": null, "preview_url": null, "schema": {"name": null, "url": null, "version": null}, "title": "Cartes des zones et arr\u00eat\u00e9s en vigueur - PMTILES - 2023", "type": "update", "url": "https://regleau.s3.gra.perf.cloud.ovh.net/pmtiles/zones_pmtiles_2023.zip"}, {"checksum": null, "created_at": "2024-06-27T09:22:55.793000+00:00", "description": "Historique des cartes - 2022\n\nCes fichiers aux formats PMTILES permettent de construire des cartes des zones et des arr\u00eat\u00e9s en vigueur sur le territoire.\nIl contient toutes les zones rattach\u00e9es aux arr\u00eat\u00e9s de restriction dont la date du jour est comprise entre la date de d\u00e9but et de fin de l\u2019arr\u00eat\u00e9 (ou si la date de fin est nulle).\n\nDescription des champs\n\nid: Identifiant unique d\u2019une zone d\u2019alerte (\u00e0 partir du 28 avril 2024 celui-ci change tout les jours car les zones sont calcul\u00e9es)\nid